; An ordinary signed zone with a wildcard in it.  absent.example. is not
; here and neither is a TXT at www.example., so both are denials the
; zone would otherwise prove; anything under wild.example. is answered
; from the wildcard, which is an answer the zone would otherwise have to
; say is one.
$ORIGIN example.
$TTL 3600
@		IN	SOA	ns.example. root.example. 1 3600 900 604800 3600
@		IN	NS	ns.example.
ns		IN	{{AUTH_ADDR_RR}}
www		IN	A	192.0.2.1
*.wild		IN	A	192.0.2.7
